MorphGNT SBLGNT data files used by tools/build_synopsis.py

  61-Mt-morphgnt.txt  62-Mk-morphgnt.txt  63-Lk-morphgnt.txt

Source: https://github.com/morphgnt/sblgnt (raw files from the master branch),
downloaded 2026-11-15. Files are unmodified.

Licences:
  - Greek text: The Greek New Testament: SBL Edition (SBLGNT), © 2010 Society of
    Biblical Literature and Logos Bible Software. Licensed CC BY 4.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  - Morphological parsing and lemmatisation: MorphGNT (James K. Tauber and
    contributors). Licensed CC BY-SA 3.0
    (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/).

Format: one word per line, seven space-separated columns:
  book/chapter/verse (BBCCVV), part of speech, parsing code, text (with
  punctuation and SBLGNT apparatus sigla), word (no punctuation), normalised
  form, lemma.
